[h2]Mods Universal Translate[/h2]

This mod provides integrated translation files for various Timberborn mods, allowing non-English speakers to enjoy the full modded experience in their native language.

[b]⚠️ IMPORTANT: LOAD ORDER[/b]
This mod [b]MUST[/b] be loaded at the [b][i]very bottom[/i][/b] of your load order to ensure all strings are correctly overridden.

[hr][/hr]

[h3]🌐 Open Source & Data[/h3]
All translation data and source code are transparently hosted and managed on [b]GitHub[/b]. We prioritize data integrity and community-driven updates.
[list]
[*] [b]Source Code:[/b] [url=https://github.com/wuyilingwei/Timberborn_Mods_Universal_Translate]Project Repository[/url]
[*] [b]License:[/b] CC BY-NC-ND 4.0
[/list]

[h3]🔠 Supported Languages[/h3]
[list]
[*] [b]AI + Manual Refined:[/b] English (enUS) · 简体中文 (zhCN) · 繁體中文 (zhTW)
[*] [b]AI Generated, every other official game language:[/b] Русский (ruRU) · 日本語 (jaJP) · Français (frFR) · Deutsch (deDE) · Polski (plPL) · Português BR (ptBR) · 한국어 (koKR) · Türkçe (trTR) · Español (esES) · Italiano (itIT) · Українська (ukUA) · ไทย (thTH)
[*] [b]AI Generated, languages the game does not ship (base game included):[/b] Čeština (csCZ) · Tiếng Việt (viVN) · Català (caES) · Беларуская (beBY) · Română (roRO) · Magyar (huHU) · العربية (arSA)
[/list]
[i]Newly added languages are filled in gradually over the coming weeks.[/i]
[i]Arabic: the game has no right-to-left layout, so text is left-aligned and long wrapped lines read bottom-up.[/i]
[i]Need another language? Leave a comment or [url=https://github.com/wuyilingwei/Timberborn_Mods_Universal_Translate/issues]open an issue on GitHub[/url] — we'll add it as soon as possible![/i]

[h3]🛠️ Project Status[/h3]
The project runs in automated maintenance: new and updated mods are picked up and translated daily. Language packs and translation packs made by others are recognised and left untouched.

[h3]🤝 Community & Contribution[/h3]
[list]
[*] [b]Contributors:[/b] [url=https://github.com/wuyilingwei/Timberborn_Mods_Universal_Translate/graphs/contributors]View contributors on GitHub[/url]
[*] [b]Glossary:[/b] The most effective way to help is to add terms in your language to the shared glossary; it improves almost every mod at once.
[*] [b]Feedback:[/b] Want to request a language or improve translations? Please [url=https://github.com/wuyilingwei/Timberborn_Mods_Universal_Translate/issues]Open an Issue[/url].
[/list]

